          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Elifási nee Bildádi nee Sofariwo axweesantá Yobu mu/aywatsingo kari máy, asma adoodá' inós tiwa kilós gan'ámkwí harafaár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Elihu garmoó Barakeli oo guruú doó Rama, kuduú Busitamo, iri amór Yóbuwí qa/iít buhhtaawo, as adoorí tiwa kilós gan'amúwí harafaár ta Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina amór mulqér Yobu i buúhh sleeme, as adoodá' afe ngiwa i qwaqwadiín dír Yobuwo, nee nguwa tlakweemáy tsa/amiisiya' ar lama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elihu ina ala xaslmamiít qooma sleémeero bariiseedá' tawa axweesi nee Yobu, asma inós ku niiná dir'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ngiwa tsaáhh adór bariiseedá' tám Yobu ngira afe tseék axweesanto, iri ló'wa buúhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
